For a team decision, active Dream or SPEC, or a Herald fact-ledger number,
run `pixi run -e pyforge-scribe scribe recall "…" --mode planning` — do
not guess from chat memory. Default omits `kind=code`. Full contract:
`AGENTS.md` § *Scribe recall (session path)*.
